@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_AUTHENTICATED_CSP_BEARER_TOKEN
@capabilityId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@componentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### First working save after manual capability creation:
### GET working-revision returns 404 WORKING_REVISION_NOT_FOUND, not an editable baseline.
### Bootstrap expectedRevision=1; classification and serviceCategory are required authored values.
### Empty contributors [] and controlDuties {} are accepted; mapped controls do not infer duties.
### Initial success returns data.revision=1 (no prior releases); use data.revision on the next save.
### The classification/category below are examples, not backend defaults.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/catalog/capabilities/{{capabilityId}}/working-revision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 1,
  "classification": "CUI",
  "serviceCategory": "Identity",
  "contributors": [],
  "controlDuties": {}
}

### Provider read contract: ordinary CSP only, never organization/support scope.
### Responses use {data: ...}. All routes are read-only; publish/approval is unchanged.
### Overview: providerName (persisted DisplayName, null if absent/blank),
### sourceArtifacts {items,page,pageSize,total}, authorizationRecord (null).
### Artifacts: componentId,componentName,sourceFormat,sourceFileName,sourceReference.
### File/reference metadata is provenance, not a separate authorization or evidence record.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/catalog/overview?page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Detail: capability (catalog item), supportingComponents, unresolvedContributorIds,
### sourceArtifacts, mappedControlIds, sourceEvidenceReferences (null),
### implementationNarrative (null). Description is never presented as implementation.
### Supports direct lookup beyond page 200; missing capability returns explicit 404.
### Catalog additions: supportingComponents [{id,name,componentType,source,description}],
### distinctOrganizationCount, workingApprovalState (Approved/NotApproved/null).
### No working row: workingRevision=null, workingApprovalState=null.
### Existing release revision is independently persisted; never synthesized from status.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/catalog/capabilities/{{capabilityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Filter is applied before count/paging, not by client-side catalog scanning.
### distinctAdoptionCount = distinct tenant-qualified systems; organizations counted separately.
### Supporting contributor IDs resolve only to provider components; unresolved IDs remain explicit.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/catalog?grouping=capability&componentId={{componentId}}&page=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary

### Missing capability: 404. Invalid componentId filter: 400.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/catalog/capabilities/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Workspace-Kind: csp
X-Workspace-Mode: ordinary
